  "description": "The native payload for Agora's AV1 video encoder extension, staged out of the AgoraRtcEngine_iOS 4.6.2 archive and packaged for .NET for iOS. AV1 encoding, for the bandwidth saving over H.264 where both ends support it. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.iOS or Net.Agora.Voice.iOS — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is AgoraVideoEncoderConfiguration with an AV1 codec type in the RTC binding.",
